# Ayaka Furina Escoffier Xianyun. ~23s Rot. Ayaka Cryo Plunge. 7 Cryo Plunges, 6 canceled with N1 to avoid the slow special dash. Xianyun does not refresh the Cryo VV; damage is frontloaded anyway. 50% Collisions.

